---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
export const prerender = true;
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for Jubili">
  <main class="mx-auto min-h-screen max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-ploy-text-primary">
    <a href="/" class="text-sm underline">← Back</a>
    <h1 class="mt-12 font-heading text-5xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 space-y-6 text-ploy-text-secondary">
      <p><strong class="text-ploy-text-primary">Placeholder: obtain legal review and complete before publishing.</strong></p>
      <p>This page must contain details of the data controller, contact enquiries, hosting, legal bases, retention periods, recipients, data-subject rights and any analytics or booking services used.</p>
      <p>Data controller: [full legal company name and address], office@jubili.co.</p>
      <p>Information submitted through the contact form is processed to respond to your enquiry. Before publishing, add the applicable legal basis, retention period and every service provider actually used.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
